{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんばんは！\n伊藤純奈です！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/junna.itou/img/junna.itou/img/2016/06/05/1635372/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"左から\n齋藤飛鳥ちゃん\n長濱ねるちゃん\n伊藤純奈ちゃん。笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ねるちゃんと念願の写真を\n撮れました！めっちゃ可愛くて\nきゅんきゅんした(・ω・)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"飛鳥ちゃんは今度パンケーキを\n食べに行く約束をしました！\nはやく行こうねーーー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/junna.itou/img/junna.itou/img/2016/06/05/1635372/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日は14th最後の\n個別でしたヽ(；▽；)ノ\nたくさんの方が並んでくださって\nほんとに嬉しかった♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"4部"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/junna.itou/img/junna.itou/img/2016/06/05/1635372/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"リリーブラウンのワンピース"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"5部"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/junna.itou/img/junna.itou/img/2016/06/05/1635372/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"トップス忘れちゃったんだけど\nパンツはスナイデル！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"後ろにひっついてるちーちゃんが\n可愛すぎる....♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/junna.itou/img/junna.itou/img/2016/06/05/1635372/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あ！「ピアスあいてたの？！」\nっていっぱい言われたけど\nイヤリングだよー(^○^)笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そしてこの日は深川さんの\n最後の握手会でもありました。\n素敵な卒業セレモニー！\nもうすぐ卒業って思うとほんとに\nさみしいけど残りの時間、\n深川さんとたくさん思い出を\n作れたらいいなぁ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"アルバム握手会、15thも\nみなさん会いに来てほしいです♡\nよろしくおねがいします！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/junna.itou/img/junna.itou/img/2016/06/05/1635372/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あ！無事テスト期間おわったよ♡\n応援してくれてありがとうっ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/junna.itou/img/junna.itou/img/2016/06/05/1635372/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これからテストのみんなは\nがんばってね〜〜！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ではでは、\nおやすみなさい！"}],"source":"archive"}